5. WHERE THE INFLATION BEGINS
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Anchoring items (provenance):
- Within-source: FULL-TEXT-CONFIRMED abstract and body statements (Fields 1–2).
- Downstream: RETRIEVED secondary summaries of 1998 media framing and IPCC TAR reliance on the MBH99 extension; RECALLED collective "hockey stick" reception (not used for classification).

Within-source component (established from paper alone):
The abstract states the warmest-years claim without the quantitative uncertainty language that appears in the body ("at 3 standard errors, or roughly a 99.7% level of certainty"). The body also uses "unprecedented warming trend" for the RPC1 / NH reconstruction. This is a modest prominence/hedging asymmetry between abstract and detailed results, not a large construct or scope leap. The measurement (proxy-calibrated NH mean under stated assumptions) is presented as supporting the claim at the reported confidence level.

Downstream component (partially provisional):
Media and subsequent literature amplified the "exceptional / unprecedented late-20th-century warmth relative to the prior centuries" framing. The IPCC TAR hockey-stick figure and the "warmest decade / year in 1000 years" language primarily rest on the MBH99 extension (and supporting studies), not a direct inflation of the MBH98 1400 claim. No retrieved citing sentence was found that assigns a claim the MBH98 data cannot support while citing only MBH98. Therefore no established CITATION-layer failure location for a misattribution is available from this retrieval.

Failure location classification:
- PAPER (minor): abstract vs. body hedging difference on the quantified warmest-years claim; "unprecedented" language applied to the reconstructed trend.
- Downstream: SUSPECTED amplification of exceptionalism framing in media/PR layer for the 1400 claim; the stronger millennium claim is carried by the successor paper (ATTRIBUTED ELSEWHERE when properly cited). Not established as primary locus of inflation of MBH98 itself.
- MIXED is not assigned because the downstream millennium claim is not shown here to be laundered through MBH98 citations.

Verification state: FULL-TEXT-CONFIRMED for within-source; RETRIEVED secondary for media/IPCC framing; RECALLED material excluded from location assignment.

